{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p4178-3e7b4254ce48968e336f","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"안녕, 복원실엔 또 무슨 일이야?","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16633355276770972804"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-2c3d6d6041bc5d7fdcca","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"혹시 나랑 얘기하려고 온 거야?","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2688749480817866284"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-231cc186ea1b168914aa","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"하하, 좋아. 문화재 복원가인 나와 얘기를 나누겠다니——무슨 얘기든 좋아!","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8895679436589116163"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-8ab58a87f35310a81e92","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"박물관은 무슨 용도로 건립된 건가요?","speaker":"","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14890683082381128571","4107575803907539036","1316535070041377868"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-28462c569765d8d7e16e","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"박물관은 말 그대로 각종 문화재를 전시하기 위해 건립된 곳이지","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15097839749189709724"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-cdba46a41accacf3d451","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"우리 역사문화박물관의 전시품은 그리 많다고 할 수 없어——너도 잘 알고 있듯 한파, 열계… 를 겪고도 보존할 수 있는 건 많지 않아","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15260650101702139068"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-9950626fe0c7dac01da4","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"그래도 우린 수집할 수 있는 문화재를 전부 찾아내 전시대에 보관하고 있어. 이런 노력이 있어서 이 박물관이 그래도 박물관다워 보이는 거지","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7546697162977381450"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-5e01098e838be63b3ca3","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"아무튼… 관람 도중에 혹시라도 불만사항이 생기면 모쪼록 너른 마음으로 이해해 줘——우리는 이미 최대한의 노력을 기울였거든","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["217353477885177041"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-c3ffa560d0b3662c95c3","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"무슨 일을 하시는 거죠?","speaker":"","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["6174128277708842946"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-e4ca9fc6b488d6b96a9c","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"말 그대로 각종 문화재를 복원하는 게 내 업무야. 지금 박물관에서 볼 수 있는 각종 문화재와 비율 모형은 거의 다 내 손을 거쳐갔다고 보면 돼","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4643533924163236692"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-bf55184b3b9b69249a79","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"예전에 난 벨로보그 예술 아카데미 조각과의 우수 졸업생이었어——처음엔 울단 교장선생님께서 모형 제작을 도와달라고 여기로 부르시더니, 문화재 복원 일을 내게 맡기셨지 뭐야……","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["446086619628181002"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-db999f58bb55c76e5efa","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"휴, 벨로보그엔 전문 인재가 너무 부족하다니까","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2954299018188386320"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-44a8675160f6556649c6","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"이제 충분한 것 같으니 전 이만 가볼게요","speaker":"","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["13091258540331389625","12725511974596416194"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-0730e7614e0b380ab5d8","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"잘 가! 우리 박물관을 마음껏 관람하렴","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7079383724781883580","7984602054249313252"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-9072053cec0d3649946d","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","text":"잘 가! 우리 박물관을 마음껏 관람하렴","speaker":"보리스","mission":"보리스","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["7079383724781883580","7984602054249313252"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14679325101815823799"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p4178","title":"보리스","page":"鲍里斯","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p4178-3e7b4254ce48968e336f","rowId":"other-npc-p4178-3e7b4254ce48968e336f","missionId":"npc-p4178","mission":"보리스","sceneId":"s985c640d0e8f8fe6","scene":"NPC 대사 2","contextId":"wiki-context-1bb19da4c871640f41b6f041","page":"鲍里斯","revision":16957,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p4178-2c3d6d6041bc5d7fdcca"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-2c3d6d6041bc5d7fdcca","rowId":"other-npc-p41